From 580a106529203051e0c2d395a0478d81cdd7b605 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LGNative <luis@nativestride.io>
Date: Fri, 26 Jun 2026 22:23:12 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 21/28] Logos: contrast-aware avatar, +17 stock logos, 5
 corrected; orphan-snapshot cleanup

- ticker-avatar: uniform dark chip; dark logos auto-lightened to white so
  DELL / GE Vernova read on the dark tile (replaces saturation-gated invert)
- 17 missing logos added (ISIN->Parqet, background-stripped to transparent)
- 5 fixed: MP/VICR bg-stripped; MC->LVMH, ENR->Siemens Energy, SU->Schneider
  (EU tickers that collided with Moelis/Energizer/Suncor in the old set)
- fork/_archive/donkey-orphan-snapshot-cleanup.sql: reclaim orphaned snapshot
  cache from a deleted account (~300 MB)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
